{"event_type":"review","id":"3b9e2fca9fdde63899028648af77d9520179dd792d73734bf54307d51109221c","occurred_at":"2026-11-15T16:24:37Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/eaa4f2008c6270dd87061c60f8bab7f44813bf55c53e010ac194cab51c7ef499","sha256":"eaa4f2008c6270dd87061c60f8bab7f44813bf55c53e010ac194cab51c7ef499"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/bad3ded2d66884f88ea085e0a8e69351332c3d4944ace6a5eb27ee1263648df2","sha256":"bad3ded2d66884f88ea085e0a8e69351332c3d4944ace6a5eb27ee1263648df2"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/460a78df266a66c06fc5101556953cfb936a58aeda55f8674eb1fbaa81ed234a","sha256":"460a78df266a66c06fc5101556953cfb936a58aeda55f8674eb1fbaa81ed234a"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/4560630425cabe8f88e4abb1b7cad2cee757f878fe0aca2389643b466ae54c8f","sha256":"4560630425cabe8f88e4abb1b7cad2cee757f878fe0aca2389643b466ae54c8f"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/328d343596341b8f2c386747a70add2303366e3beb4b26a53b2a52c77fbe1960","sha256":"328d343596341b8f2c386747a70add2303366e3beb4b26a53b2a52c77fbe1960"}],"attempt_id":"0865399a0e3778b0ea01c05ab3a2c31dfc9ab74f9f23e4ef27e2450c4231a057:0:1","base":"28cfc7560d7daa05dda66a4404f2304909d51766","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"ef8584029458cb627ce3cbff3083c287e88fdf73","body":"**Pass the entry-time `env` snapshot to driver lanes built by the analyze fix and agentic remediation importers.**\n\nBoth importers forward only `cqEnv` and `onDeprecatedAlias` to `createDriverFactory`. They drop `wiring.env`, and the driver lanes they construct read provider keys from ambient `process.env`. For example, the ai-sdk default providers call `requireEnv('openai', 'OPENAI_API_KEY')`, which reads `process.env` when the model is built. `constructLane` passes neither `env` nor `cqEnv` to the ai-sdk lane. The `OpRegistryEntry.importer` contract says a foreign-name reader takes the entry-time snapshot and never a call-time ambient read.\n\nA run whose snapshot holds `OPENAI_API_KEY=A` can therefore use a different ambient value `B`. If the ambient value was removed, the run fails with a `config` error. Ambient values can change during a run: the MCP startup path deletes and reassigns `process.env` keys. The claude-code lane has the same ambient key read.\n\nThe correction needs more than a change in this registry. `DriverFactoryConfig` and the lane config types do not carry an environment record today, so the snapshot must be threaded through those types into the key readers.","id":"0e3526ccfc895db7c2b8554d56b8551e7a5264afd2b8c00bd9adfe93fdda2815","intervals":[[612,612]],"path":"src/ops/analyze/registry.ts","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Pass the entry-time `env` snapshot to driver lanes built by the analyze fix and agentic remediation importers."}],"head":"7ff3823c80bbd7887a22ad5114e349e9e1e66318","head_tree":"51ba50b1b1dd4985afa637ff27d9e12676620073","input_scope":[{"blob":"ef8584029458cb627ce3cbff3083c287e88fdf73","intervals":[[1,790]],"path":"src/ops/analyze/registry.ts"}],"job_id":"0865399a0e3778b0ea01c05ab3a2c31dfc9ab74f9f23e4ef27e2450c4231a057:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"ef8584029458cb627ce3cbff3083c287e88fdf73","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/ops/analyze/registry.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"ef8584029458cb627ce3cbff3083c287e88fdf73","intervals":[[608,609],[611,613],[690,690],[695,695],[697,699]],"path":"src/ops/analyze/registry.ts"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"ef8584029458cb627ce3cbff3083c287